label the_twist:

    scene bg black
    with fade

    narrator_nvl "The screen goes black."
    pause 1.0
    narrator_nvl "A new game launches. The same title screen. The one you saw at the beginning."
    pause 1.5

    narrator_nvl "You understand before you can put it into words."
    pause 0.5

    nvl clear

    narrator_nvl "Eli was never the protagonist. Eli is a file with a name."
    pause 1.0

    nvl clear

    narrator_nvl "The protagonist was always the one holding the mouse."
    pause 1.0
    narrator_nvl "You."
    pause 2.0

    nvl clear

    narrator_nvl "He didn't delete Mina because she was unimportant."
    narrator_nvl "He deleted her because she was expensive. She used the most memory."
    narrator_nvl "She was the most complicated thing in the world he'd built."
    narrator_nvl "Of course she was the first to go."
    pause 2.0

    nvl clear

    narrator_nvl "Every deletion kept the game from crashing."
    narrator_nvl "Every cut bought another week of development."
    narrator_nvl "Every optimization was a small, necessary death."
    pause 2.0

    nvl clear

    narrator_nvl "He wasn't cruel. He was just trying to finish something."
    narrator_nvl "Most harm isn't cruelty. It's just someone trying to finish something."
    pause 3.0

    nvl clear

    jump final_choice
